  "summary": "Backports PR #35878 to the 31.x maintenance branch and prepares the branch for the v31.3 point release. It updates P2P transaction inventory handling to process unique transaction announcements only, avoiding spurious work on conflicting advertisements. It also bumps the project version and updates documentation and manual pages for v31.3.",
  "problem": "The 31.x maintenance branch performs redundant processing when receiving conflicting transaction inventory announcements that cannot both enter the mempool, and it lacks the version and documentation updates required for releasing v31.3.",
